## 4. Supabase Kurulumu (kullanıcı/şirket verisi)

1. https://supabase.com → yeni proje oluştur
2. **Project Settings → API** → şu ikisini not al:
   - `Project URL` → `.env`'de `SUPABASE_URL`
   - `service_role` anahtarı (⚠️ `anon` key DEĞİL) → `.env`'de `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY`
3. **SQL Editor**'a git, aşağıdaki script'i çalıştır:

```sql
create table if not exists companies (
  id bigserial primary key,
  name text not null,
  sql_server text,
  sql_database text,
  sql_username text,
  sql_password text,
  created_at timestamptz default now()
);

create table if not exists users (
  id bigserial primary key,
  email text unique not null,
  password_hash text not null,
  company_id bigint references companies(id),
  title text default 'calisan',
  verified boolean default false,
  must_change_password boolean default false,
  verification_code text,
  code_expires_at timestamptz,
  created_at timestamptz default now()
);

alter table companies disable row level security;
alter table users disable row level security;
```

Zaten eski bir `users` tablon varsa (bu projenin önceki sürümünden), onun yerine:

```sql
alter table users add column if not exists company_id bigint references companies(id);
alter table users add column if not exists title text default 'calisan';
alter table users add column if not exists must_change_password boolean default false;
```

